// The exe's own icon: what Explorer shows for the file, what a pinned
// shortcut carries, and what the taskbar falls back to before the window
// is up. The running window sets its own separately (src/winframe.rs).
//
// Resource id 1 is deliberate: Windows shows the numerically lowest ICON
// resource as the file's icon, so this has to stay the lowest one here.
//
// platitude.res is the compiled form and is what build.rs hands the
// linker. After changing platitude.ico, rebuild it with the Windows SDK
// resource compiler, from this directory:
//
//   rc.exe /nologo /fo platitude.res platitude.rc
//
1 ICON "platitude.ico"
